  "description": "QIKZOC crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C70 H102 Mn2 N4 O34 Tb4,2(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Mn1 (Mn) has 4 O neighbors; Tb1 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 9 O neighbors; Mn2 (Mn) has 4 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb4 (Tb) has 9 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.407-3.964 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 98.55-122.05°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [MnIII2TbIII4(L1)2(L2)2(μ3-OH)4(μ1,3-pivalate)6(NO3)2]·2CH3CN (C74H108N6O34Mn2Tb4; CCDC C70H102Mn2N4O34Tb4·2(C2H3N)). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 2 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)). Article name explicitly identifies Mn(III), Tb(III).",
